<title>JAPAN: S&amp;P assigns AA+ rating to Denmark's samurai bonds.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P assigns AA+ rating to Denmark's samurai bonds.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's Corp (S&amp;P) said on Tuesday that it had assigned an AA+ rating to Denmark's yen/Australian dollar dual currency samurai bonds totalling 10 billion yen.</p>
<p>The outlook of the bonds, which mature on November 25, 1999, and have a coupon of 5.35 percent, is stable, it added.</p>
</text>
